{
  "arguments": {
    "query": "vLLM prefix caching 会缓存未满的 block 吗？"
  },
  "observation": {
    "evidence": [
      {
        "id": "E73d630e26f884685ac0b2236",
        "chunk_id": "79cbddddd5dbd66594a28d11",
        "parent_id": "886338dde2952311210ca4f1",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L7-L13",
        "content": "```text\n                    Block 1                  Block 2                  Block 3\n         [A gentle breeze stirred] [the leaves as children] [laughed in the distance]\nBlock 1: |<--- block tokens ---->|\nBlock 2: |<------- prefix ------>| |<--- block tokens --->|\nBlock 3: |<------------------ prefix -------------------->| |<--- block tokens ---->|\n```",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E24c3ef9b22499dc6e0aa0275",
        "chunk_id": "6d9bab0bd5362b1c1998eeb9",
        "parent_id": "48b07ffb4f895d811de05c83",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L5-L5",
        "content": "While there are many ways to implement prefix caching, vLLM chooses a hash-based approach. Specifically, we hash each kv-cache block by the tokens in the block and the tokens in the prefix before the block:",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E3d7c1fe01568fb7fdc66f905",
        "chunk_id": "72af2def668fa344603bc3eb",
        "parent_id": "df1b00cc0af2ab56357a611c",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L102-L102",
        "content": "The prefix caching in vLLM v1 is implemented in the KV cache manager. The basic building block is the “Block” data class (simplified):",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E90b31537bae2c3648ca73c6e",
        "chunk_id": "06cc02a6f11ba81ce52bf68f",
        "parent_id": "23edcec3f8d01408e418d987",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md",
        "sha256": "0a8a9e9095055c4f8e0cdaf078e3194ab06428222d65abb9c827f6879607ce61",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-prefix_caching.md#L192-L192",
        "content": "In v0, when detecting block 3 is duplicated, we free block 3 and let Request 2 use block 1 instead, so its block table becomes `[0, 1]` in Time 1.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
